                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "West Michigan, our Secretary of State @JocelynBenson is doing everything in her power to keep your vote safe and expand options to exercise your vote.\n\nWe teamed up to remind you of all the upcoming deadlines. Visit https://t.co/VyRRtj43Cu for more resources! https://t.co/XLw0KEJpPj",
