                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "March is National Nutrition Month, a time to double down on efforts to ensure all of our neighbors have access to healthy, fresh foods. Crucial programs such as SNAP and WIC are lifelines for families, aging adults, individuals with disabilities, and more.\u00a0\n\u2028I\u2019m laser-focused on protecting these programs so folks don\u2019t have to struggle to put food on their table.",
